      <file>src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/ (the PCF that will bind the new Lookup discriminator — placement is 071, but confirm its binding contract)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-06 / NFR-04">Additive only. Add the 11 typed lookups + a NEW Lookup discriminator + naming-edited marker + default-thread marker. MUST NOT retype the existing Text `sprk_regardingrecordtype` (breaking — ThreadResolver + membership + timeline filters read it); it stays as the denormalized copy.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">The 11 typed lookups mirror `RegardingFieldMap.All` (same 11 target entities + the same `sprk_regarding{...}` field-name convention). MUST NOT invent a new regarding mechanism or a different field-name scheme.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-046">No second regarding mechanism — thread regarding is RegardingResolver (via these lookups + the Lookup discriminator), NOT CommunicationConnections or the Field Mapping Framework.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec Q2">Do NOT add category / tags / description to the thread — regarding + name only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Consume task 001's audit note — add ONLY missing columns; verify lookup/option-set conventions via Dataverse MCP `describe`/`read_query` BEFORE creation; do NOT recreate any existing column.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-027">Author schema into the project's managed solution per subscription-isolation/solution conventions; no direct prod-only unmanaged changes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Schema ONLY. No resolver/naming logic (that is 070/071), no RegardingResolver PCF placement (that is 071), no BFF code.</constraint>
  </constraints>

