    The single most important property is non-breaking: the Text `sprk_regardingrecordtype` MUST survive untouched — ThreadResolver, membership derivation, and timeline filters all read it. The Lookup discriminator is a NEW field, not a retype. If any tool pushes toward retyping the Text field, STOP — that is the forbidden breaking change (NFR-04, spec Out-of-Scope).

